# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# .gitignore — ab-cloud-research
# NOTE: PDF/DOCX/PPTX files are FIRST-CLASS CONTENT of this repository
# (monographs, preprints, 3D lab outputs) — they are NOT ignored here.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── Julia ───
*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
Manifest.toml
LocalPreferences.toml
InstantSandbox.toml
deps/deps.jl

# ─── Python ───
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ─── Generated run outputs (regenerable) ───
# NOTE: results/run_20260902_134759/ is a FIRST-CLASS ARTIFACT (the v19
# two-pass run of 2026-09-02: reports + logs, no plots) — force-added.
results/run_*/
code/reports/
*.log
!results/*.txt

# ─── Node (React apps) ───
node_modules/
# committed prebuilt bundles are first-class (GitHub Pages ready):
!apps/**/dist/

# ─── MkDocs build ───
site/

# ─── OS / editor noise ───
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-*

# ─── TeX aux (preprint builds) ───
*.aux
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.blg
*.bbl

# ─── Do NOT ignore (explicit reminders) ───
!monographs/**/*.pdf
!monographs/**/*.docx
!monographs/**/*.pptx
!lab-3d/**/*.pdf
!verification/**/*.pdf
